  "id": "ability-trait",
  "term": "ability trait",
  "definition": "An ability trait is an underlying, not directly observed capacity that is inferred from related measures or behaviors. In this source, it refers to a latent physical ability that is estimated indirectly from step-count data and self-reported physical activity measures.",
